Package: worldpopulation
Type: Package
Title: Analyze Population Within Circles Around City Centers Worldwide
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Pete", "O",
      email = "pete@example.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Query population within specified radii around global city centers using
    high-resolution Global Human Settlement Layer (GHS-POP) data. Rank cities by
    population density at various distances, compare urban agglomerations, and analyze
    population distribution patterns. Inspired by Tom Forth's Circle Populations project.
